We’ve already ordered both of the new 2019
iPads so we’re gonna be doing in-depth comparison

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:12.939
videos soon, so if you’re not already subscribed,
make sure to do so now!

00:04:12.939 --> 00:04:17.699
Thanks for watching, and we’ll see you in
